<!-- The front of a bus, in white. The windscreen, destination sign and headlights are holes
     (evenOdd), not painted on, so this one drawing also works as the monochrome themed icon.
     Adaptive icons are 108dp with the middle 66dp always visible; the bus fits inside that. -->
